#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:54
#: 458bcb22b668434394bbd408cb552ddf
msgid ""
"Serial port protocols (Telem, GPS, etc.) can be adjusted to personal "
"preferences using the ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter."
msgstr "串口协议（数传、GPS 等）可使用 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数根据个人偏好进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:57
#: 688cd9cd1e524e14b7d30ddf6301e399
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:59
#: e357d6dfe91e40dbb7669e7ae34343f2
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to timer input, can be used for all"
" ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connetion. However, Fport, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry"
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外，这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接。但 Fport 以这种方式连接时，只能提供 RC 信号而无遥测功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:61
#: 95d7242d6bd14ba99f8725df322537e3
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL4(UART8) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using UART8. "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to “23”."
msgstr ""
"要在 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中使用 CRSF 和嵌入式遥测，需要使用完整的 UART（如 "
"SERIAL4(UART8)）进行接收机连接。以下为使用 UART8 "
"的设置。:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 应设为「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:63
#: ef535448010049ab966473778e65d263
msgid ""
"Fport would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to”15”"
msgstr "Fport 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为「15」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:64
#: 2b50c7a89a334de4bb9fc556d3d0d85a
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to “0”"
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为「0」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:65
#: f4ea6a8569f04afd841a94510f709ea6
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to “4” "
"and connects only the UART8 TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」，且仅连接 UART8 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:67
#: 08e3877866ab4e67b0ac10ddf540945b
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems "
"<common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任意 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`遥控系统 <common-rc-"
"systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:70
#: 7d35aca0610749a09cdc99c16db1737a
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:72
#: 1b87164a254b4996b935c870f4642b18
msgid ""
"The ThePeach FCC-K1 supports up to 13 PWM outputs. All outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats."
msgstr "ThePeach FCC-K1 最多支持 13 路 PWM 输出。所有输出均支持常规 PWM 输出格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:74
#: 5416eb53f921490583fa026109226bd2
msgid "The 5 AUX outputs are in 2 groups and also support DShot:"
msgstr "5 路 AUX 输出分为 2 组，同时支持 DShot："

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:76
#: 7482e596e1674abd8622b2565a2c9fd1
msgid "AUX 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "AUX 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:77
#: 346ace84d83646c3acb33881b708704c
msgid "AUX 5 in group2"
msgstr "AUX 5 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:79
#: cebe1812edc34fc5881d972315afa692
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需要使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组中任意输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:84
#: e8feafd7fd894f72969eac67fed26b95
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:86
#: 76dfa18f2d7247c1abaf54af73d5d219
msgid ""
"The board has 1 dedicated power monitor port whit a pin connector. It is "
"intended for use with the Analog power monitor supplied with the autopilot."
msgstr "飞控板有 1 个专用电源监测端口（带针脚连接器），用于连接飞控随附的模拟电源监测器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:89
#: 49c75b0ade2944cdb3e0362e17d69451
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:91
#: 17da566f34754f4782996fbc282298f4
msgid ""
"The ThePeach FCC-K1 has a built-in MPU9250 compass. Due to potential "
"interference the autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as "
"part of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "ThePeach FCC-K1 内置 MPU9250 罗盘。由于潜在干扰，飞控通常与 GPS/罗盘组合模块中的外部 I2C 罗盘配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:94
#: 1e63c1f22d4849dd97d183cb7be0feac
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:96
#: 4a10e9b96f3a4a888d59120da43e09ca
msgid ""
"The 5 AUX outputs can be used as GPIOs (relays, buttons, RPM etc). To use "
"them you need to set the output’s SERVOx_FUNTION to -1. See `GPIOs "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-gpios.html#common-gpios>`_ page "
"for more information"
msgstr ""
"5 路 AUX 输出可用作 GPIO（继电器、按钮、RPM 等）。使用时需将对应输出的 SERVOx_FUNCTION 设为 -1。详情请参阅 "
"`GPIO <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-gpios.html#common-gpios>`_ "
"页面。"

