#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:118
#: 0ae7616d28e5499abef1aa076903acaf
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader, "
"allowing the loading of xxxxxx.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot "
"compatible ground station."
msgstr "飞控板出厂预装 ArduPilot 兼容引导程序，可通过任意 ArduPilot 兼容地面站加载 xxxxxx.apj 固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-k1.rst:120
#: 0101c2ba017d42a78071c25cc570da55
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`_ in sub-folders labeled “thepeach-k1”."
msgstr ""
"该飞控的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`_ 的标有「thepeach-k1」的子文件夹中找到。"

